<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase">
    <defName>Crimson_CloakingDevice</defName>
    <label>위상 은폐기</label>
    <thingClass>SaveOurShip2.Building_ShipCloakingDevice</thingClass>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Crimson/Support/CloakingDevice</texPath>
      <graphicClass>SaveOurShip2.Graphic_SingleOnOff</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>(3,3)</drawSize>
      <damageData>
        <cornerTL>Damage/Corner</cornerTL>
        <cornerTR>Damage/Corner</cornerTR>
        <cornerBL>Damage/Corner</cornerBL>
        <cornerBR>Damage/Corner</cornerBR>
      </damageData>
    </graphicData>
    <altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer>
    <passability>PassThroughOnly</passability>
    <blockWind>true</blockWind>
    <castEdgeShadows>true</castEdgeShadows>
    <fillPercent>0.9</fillPercent>
    <blockLight>false</blockLight>
    <canOverlapZones>false</canOverlapZones>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToBuild>9600</WorkToBuild>
      <MaxHitPoints>1000</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <description>Generates a field which masks heat emissions, hiding your ship from passive scans. This prevents random ship battles from starting, but is not helpful once combat has already begun. It also cannot protect you from the powerful scanners used to find ships with high Notoriety.\n\nWhile the device is active, your ship's heat sinks will be disabled and heat capacity will decrease.</description>
    <designationCategory>Crimson_CS</designationCategory>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Power">
        <compClass>CompPowerTrader</compClass>
        <basePowerConsumption>5000</basePowerConsumption>
        <transmitsPower>true</transmitsPower>
      </li>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Flickable" />
      <li Class="SaveOurShip2.CompProps_GraphicOnOff" />
      <li Class="SaveOurShip2.CompProps_ShipHeat">
        <compClass>SaveOurShip2.CompShipHeatSource</compClass>
        <heatPerSecond>1</heatPerSecond>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <placeWorkers>
      <li>SaveOurShip2.PlaceWorker_OnShipHull</li>
    </placeWorkers>
    <rotatable>false</rotatable>
    <costList>
      <Steel>80</Steel>
      <Plasteel>120</Plasteel>
      <Gold>20</Gold>
      <ComponentSpacer>12</ComponentSpacer>
    </costList>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded>Heavy</terrainAffordanceNeeded>
    <staticSunShadowHeight>1.0</staticSunShadowHeight>
    <researchPrerequisites>
      <li>ShipCloaking</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <designationHotKey>Misc1</designationHotKey>
    <size>(3,3)</size>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Vehicles.CustomCostDefModExtension">
        <cost>10000</cost>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase">
    <defName>Crimson_LifeSupport</defName>
    <label>맥동 생명유지장치</label>
    <designatorDropdown>Ship_LifeSupports</designatorDropdown>
    <thingClass>Building</thingClass>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Crimson/Support/LifeSupport</texPath>
      <graphicClass>CrimsonSOS2.CrimsonWallStateGraphic</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>(3,1)</drawSize>
      <drawOffsetNorth>(0,0,0.9)</drawOffsetNorth>
      <drawOffsetSouth>(0,0,-0.9)</drawOffsetSouth>
      <drawOffsetEast>(0.9,0,0)</drawOffsetEast>
      <drawOffsetWest>(-0.9,0,0)</drawOffsetWest>
    </graphicData>
    <researchPrerequisites>
      <li>ShipLifeSupport</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <altitudeLayer>BuildingOnTop</altitudeLayer>
    <passability>Standable</passability>
    <blockWind>true</blockWind>
    <castEdgeShadows>true</castEdgeShadows>
    <fillPercent>0.8</fillPercent>
    <blockLight>false</blockLight>
    <canOverlapZones>false</canOverlapZones>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToBuild>30000</WorkToBuild>
      <MaxHitPoints>100</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <description>밀폐된 함선 구획에 산소를 공급하는 맥동 생명유지장치입니다. Dubs Bad Hygiene 활성화 시 SOS2 원본과 같은 자동 급수(5틱당 1L), 25,000L 물 저장, 25,000L 오수 수용 및 내장 정수·멸균 기능을 제공합니다. 작동 중 연결된 급수망의 물을 멸균하여 수인성 질병 위험을 제거하고, 유입 오수는 다음 처리 틱에 잔여물 없이 제거합니다. 내장 자동 보일러는 난방 출력 2,500과 기본 온수 탱크 10개 분량의 열 저장 용량을 갖추며, 전원이 공급되고 장치가 작동하는 동안 연결된 온수탱크의 실제 물 온도를 100%로 유지합니다. 온수 사용과 자연 냉각으로 온도가 떨어지지 않으며 별도의 온도조절기 설정에 의존하지 않습니다. 정전·전원 차단 시 자동 급수·가열·멸균·오수 처리가 중단되며, 저장된 온기는 기본 온수 탱크와 같은 방식으로 식습니다. 소비전력은 7,500W입니다.</description>
    <size>(3,1)</size>
    <designationCategory>Crimson_CS</designationCategory>
    <comps>
      <li Class="SaveOurShip2.CompProps_ShipCachePart" />
      <li Class="CompProperties_Power">
        <compClass>CompPowerTrader</compClass>
        <basePowerConsumption>7500</basePowerConsumption>
        <transmitsPower>false</transmitsPower>
      </li>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Flickable" />
      <li Class="SaveOurShip2.CompProps_LifeSupport" />
      <li Class="SaveOurShip2.CompProps_GraphicOnOff" />
      <li MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey" Class="CompProperties_OxygenPusher">
        <requiresPower>true</requiresPower>
        <airPerSecondPerHundredCells>2</airPerSecondPerHundredCells>
      </li>
      <li Class="DubsBadHygiene.CompProperties_Pipe" MayRequire="Dubwise.DubsBadHygiene"><mode>Sewage</mode></li>
      <li Class="DubsBadHygiene.CompProperties_WaterStorage" MayRequire="Dubwise.DubsBadHygiene"><WaterStorageCap>25000</WaterStorageCap><Auto>true</Auto><Tickrate>5</Tickrate><AutoGenRate>1</AutoGenRate></li>
      <li Class="DubsBadHygiene.CompProperties_SepticTank" MayRequire="Dubwise.DubsBadHygiene"><compClass>CrimsonSOS2.CrimsonLifeSupportSewageProcessor</compClass><capacity>25000</capacity><priority>2</priority></li>
      <li Class="DubsBadHygiene.CompProperties_WaterFiltration" MayRequire="Dubwise.DubsBadHygiene"><compClass>CrimsonSOS2.CrimsonLifeSupportSterilizer</compClass></li>
      <li Class="DubsBadHygiene.CompProperties_CompBoiler" MayRequire="Dubwise.DubsBadHygiene">
        <BaseCapacity>2500</BaseCapacity>
        <ThermostatControl>true</ThermostatControl>
        <ShouldUsePowerModes>false</ShouldUsePowerModes>
      </li>
      <li Class="DubCore.CompProperties_HeatStore" MayRequire="Dubwise.DubsBadHygiene">
        <compClass>DubsBadHygiene.CompHeatStore</compClass>
        <StoreCapacity>1000</StoreCapacity>
        <RiseRate>0.0024</RiseRate>
        <FallRate>0.00001</FallRate>
        <ForRunningWater>true</ForRunningWater>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <costList>
      <Steel>60</Steel>
      <Plasteel>30</Plasteel>
      <ComponentSpacer>4</ComponentSpacer>
    </costList>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded>Heavy</terrainAffordanceNeeded>
    <staticSunShadowHeight>1.0</staticSunShadowHeight>
    <designationHotKey>Misc5</designationHotKey>
    <constructionSkillPrerequisite>8</constructionSkillPrerequisite>
    <rotatable>true</rotatable>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="Vehicles.CustomCostDefModExtension">
        <cost>10000</cost>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
    <pathCost>0</pathCost>
    <building>
      <isEdifice>false</isEdifice>
      <isAttachment>true</isAttachment>
    </building>
    <placeWorkers>
      <li>CrimsonSOS2.CrimsonLifeSupportWallPlaceWorker</li>
    </placeWorkers>
  </ThingDef>
